{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-weak-pa.md","title":"Weak Peano Arithmetic","display":"df-weak-pa — Weak Peano Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-weak-pa","aliases":["92-df-weak-pa"],"display":"df-weak-pa — Weak Peano Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-induction-schema]]","[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-weak-pa"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-weak-pa</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weak-pa — Weak Peano Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_G\\)</span> (restricted induction-schema constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" href=\"?note=b0214c7ec3ea52ef\" title=\"92-df-induction-schema\">92-df-induction-schema</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (bounded-formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (Sigma-1 formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1,\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G\">\\(I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1,\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI\\Delta_0&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Delta_0^G),\\\\\nI\\Sigma_1&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Sigma_1^G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Q,I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI\\Delta_0&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Delta_0^G),\\\\\nI\\Sigma_1&amp;\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Sigma_1^G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Q,I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弱PA：限制归纳模式的PA片段</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>（Robinson算术）：PA去掉归纳，最弱</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span>：仅<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>-归纳</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Sigma_1\">\\(I\\Sigma_1\\)</span>：仅<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-归纳</li>\n<li>每个元素都是一个公理集，而不是一个形式系统三元组；需要可证关系时还须配上签名和规则</li>\n<li>Robinson <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>本质不可判定，因此相容、有效可公理化并扩张<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的这些片段受不完备性约束；不能把“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>已够”理解成只要语言里出现<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的符号就够</li>\n<li>弱PA的证明力比PA弱</li>\n<li>有界算术基于弱PA的思想</li>\n<li>不完备性定理的前提可弱化至<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Q$ (Robinson arithmetic, see [[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"b0214c7ec3ea52ef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_G$ (restricted induction-schema constructor, see [[92-df-induction-schema]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G$ (bounded-formula class, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (Sigma-1 formula class, see [[92-df-sigma1-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1,\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}pa}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nI\\Delta_0&\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Delta_0^G),\\\\\nI\\Sigma_1&\\coloneqq Q\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_G(\\Sigma_1^G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WeakPA}_G&\\coloneqq\\{Q,I\\Delta_0,I\\Sigma_1\\}\n\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_G).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"I\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":1646,"backlinks":[{"id":"a433d8f87b4f42f5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\Delta_0$ (bounded arithmetic fragment, see [[92-df-weak-pa]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exc